    <name>pdo_lake</name>
    <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
    <summary>PDO driver for TiDB Cloud Lake and Databend</summary>
    <description>Native PDO driver for TiDB Cloud Lake and Databend. It links the official Rust driver (lake-driver) through a C ABI and supports the REST API and FlightSQL transports, prepared statements, streaming results, transactions, sessions, stages and bulk loading. Building requires Rust 1.88 or newer (cargo on PATH), or a prebuilt liblake_ffi.a passed with --with-lake-ffi.</description>
